  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional support to Policy Research Institute (PRI) to develop expertise and advocate for policy action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional support from FCDO will support the strategic evolution of PRI towards enhancing its impact and influence in the field of public policy. FCDO funding will help PRI ensure its sustainability and enhance the effectiveness of its policy advocacy. Emphasis will be given on building human capital, enhancing communication tactics, and looking for new and additional financing sources.</narrative>
  </description>
